---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About — André Nicolas" description="About André Nicolas, a Frontend Engineer working across UX, product, and engineering.">
  <main class="wrapper about"><section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1 class="display">Software is only useful when people can make sense of it.</h1></section><section class="story"><img src="/assets/portrait.jpg" alt="Portrait of André Nicolas" /><div><p>I’m a frontend engineer interested in the space between software, product and people. Most of my work has been in complex SaaS environments, where good engineering is necessary—but the product also needs to make sense to the person using it.</p><p>At MSPA, I work across privacy and compliance products used by more than ten companies. My primary craft is frontend engineering: shaping interfaces, architecture and interaction models that remain understandable as products grow.</p><p>When a product needs it, I work beyond the UI too—contributing to APIs, Go services, event-driven systems, data and delivery. The title stays frontend engineer; the reach is there to help the product move.</p></div></section><section class="principles"><p class="eyebrow">What I care about</p><div><h2 class="display">Clarity is an engineering outcome.</h2><p>Useful software respects attention. It explains complex work, gives people confidence, and leaves room for the task at hand.</p></div></section><section class="details"><div><p class="eyebrow">Based in</p><p>Maceió, Brazil</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Elsewhere</p><p><a href="https://github.com/devAndreNicolas" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><br /><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/devandrenicolas" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a></p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><p><a href="mailto:devandrenicolas@gmail.com">devandrenicolas@gmail.com</a></p></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.about { padding:5rem 0 8rem; }.intro { max-width:62rem; }.intro h1 { margin-top:1rem; font-size:clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 6.8rem); }.story { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.72fr 1fr; gap:clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); margin-top:6rem; }.story img { width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/5; object-fit:cover; filter:grayscale(100%); }.story div { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1.5rem; max-width:39rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:1.12rem; }.principles { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.72fr 1fr; gap:clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); margin-top:7rem; padding-top:1rem; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }.principles h2 { font-size:clamp(2.4rem, 4.4vw, 4.5rem); }.principles p:last-child { margin-top:1rem; color:var(--muted); }.details { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:2rem; margin-top:6rem; padding-top:1rem; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }.details p + p { margin-top:.4rem; }.details a { color:var(--blue); } @media(max-width:42rem) { .story,.principles,.details { grid-template-columns:1fr; }.story { margin-top:4rem; }.principles { margin-top:4rem; }.details { margin-top:4rem; gap:1.5rem; } }</style>
